at\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">Cows are made of milk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thompson.\" title=\"Thompson.\">Thompson.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hey_mate.\" title=\"Hey mate.\">Hey mate.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">Drier than you think, chalk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A 1970s camping kettle.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.\" title=\"Supping from the fountain.\">Supping from the fountain.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A 1970s camping kettle.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_1970s_camping_kettle..png/revision/latest?cb=20251106224546\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_1970s_camping_kettle..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251106224546\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_1970s_camping_kettle..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251106224546 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/17/A_1970s_camping_kettle..png/revision/latest?cb=20251106224546 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_1970s_camping_kettle..png\" data-image-name=\"A 1970s camping kettle..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.\" title=\"Supping from the fountain.\">Supping from the fountain.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A 1970s camping kettle.</b></i> is the ninth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 6 November 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> describes <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a>’s scream as sounding like \"a 1970s camping kettle\", during discussion of her attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Build_a_tower_of_bricks_on_this_trolley,_then_push_it_down_the_slope\" title=\"Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope\">Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope</a> task. The title card is of a brick and the baby plant head. The brick references the <a href=\"/wiki/Build_a_tower_of_bricks_on_this_trolley,_then_push_it_down_the_slope\" title=\"Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope\">Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope</a> task, and the baby plant head references the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_fantastic_15-second_film_featuring_your_face_in_full_frame\" title=\"Make the most fantastic 15-second film featuring your face in full frame\">Make the most fantastic 15-second film featuring your face in full frame</a> task. There is also a jockey's hat, which comes from the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_your_jockey_weigh_almost_exactly_the_same_as_Alex\" title=\"Make your jockey weigh almost exactly the same as Alex\">Make your jockey weigh almost exactly the same as Alex</a> task.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The stakes are high and the scores are tight, with all five competitors still in with a chance of winning <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' glittering bonce. Efficient assistant <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> shows off his jockey silks in the weighing room, while <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> makes sexy use of a feather boa and shin pads. <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> cause calamity with a tower of bricks, <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> watches a croissant float by, and <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> pays homage to the dawn of cinema.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/9/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_respected_item_that_retains_its_credibility_when_you_talk_about_it_in_a_high-pitched_voice\" title=\"Most respected item that retains its credibility when you talk about it in a high-pitched voice\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most respected item that retains its credibility when you talk about it in a high-pitched voice.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Build_a_tower_of_bricks_on_this_trolley,_then_push_it_down_the_slope\" title=\"Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Build a tower of bricks on this trolley, then push it down the slope. You may not touch the trolley after it passes the start line. As well as bricks, all the contents of one of these bins must be part of your tower, but nothing else. You may only look inside the bins once, and only for as long as you can scream. You must replace each lid before looking in the next bin. You have three attempts, during which you must also scream.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_your_jockey_weigh_almost_exactly_the_same_as_Alex\" title=\"Make your jockey weigh almost exactly the same as Alex\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make your jockey weigh almost exactly the same as Alex. If your jockey weighs more than Alex, you are disqualified. You may only get two readings from the scales.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Sexiest jockey.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small><b>1</b></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small><b>1</b></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_fantastic_15-second_film_featuring_your_face_in_full_frame\" title=\"Make the most fantastic 15-second film featuring your face in full frame\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most fantastic 15-second film featuring your face in full frame.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Become_the_person_the_Taskmaster_shouts\" title=\"Become the person the Taskmaster shouts\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Become the person the Taskmaster shouts. You will have one minute to draw yourself a new bottom of your face and body. Also, you must bob up and down throughout your attempt.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>A 1970s camping kettle.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920140540\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.162 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1011/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26935/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 734/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800550/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   87.564      1 -total\n 48.59%   42.546      1 Template:Spoilers\n 46.09%   40.358      1 Template:MessageBox\n 24.67%   21.606      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 18.89%   16.537      1 Template:Episodes\n 11.38%    9.963     10 Template:Link\n  2.50%    2.187      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.46%    2.150      1 Template:Quote\n  2.42%    2.118      5 Template:Color\n  2.13%    1.864      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:5798-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920140540 and revision id 44632. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}}}